n></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>Presentation 1. A regularization method for an infinite system of ill-posed J-monotone operator equations, presented by Dr. Nguyễn Dương Nguyễn. </span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>Presentation 2. Integrating the LSTM model with moving average indicators in analyzing and forecasting Bitcoin prices, by the authors Dr. Phùng Duy Quang and Nguyễn Hoàng Duy, presented by student Nguyễn Hoàng Duy (K62, Institute of International Economics and Business). </span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span> <span>